    "cwe": "CWE-266",
    "description": "Incorrect privilege assignment in the user and group reconciliation logic in AWS ssosync before 2.9.5 might allow an authenticated remote user who is assigned a reused Google Workspace e-mail address or group name to inherit the IAM Identity Center group memberships and permission set assignments of a previously synchronized, unrelated identity, via automatic synchronization of that Google Workspace account or group.\n\n\n\nTo remediate this issue, users should upgrade to version 2.9.5 or later.",
